OL,3,AMore than 12 US military aircraft leave
OL,4,Asecond UK base
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 12 US Air Force aircraft have
OL,7,Fleft a second airbase in Britain weeks
OL,8,Fafter the US withdrew its bombers from
OL,9,FRAF Fairford over a suspected
OL,10,FIran-linked security incident.
OL,12,FThe latest planes to leave, two Boeing
OL,13,FStratotanker KC-135 refuelling
OL,14,Faircraft, flew from RAF Mildenhall in
OL,15,FSuffolk on Tuesday afternoon, with one
OL,16,Fapparently headed towards Germany and
OL,17,Fanother seen landing at Prestwick
OL,18,FAirport near Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
