OL,3,AFirst day of Ukraine peace talks
OL,4,Aconstructive, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first of two days of trilateral
OL,7,Ftalks between Ukraine, Russia and the
OL,8,FUS aimed at ending the war in Ukraine
OL,9,Fhas concluded in Abu Dhabi.
OL,11,FWhile senior officials from Kyiv and
OL,12,FMoscow were tight-lipped after the four
OL,13,Fhour-long discussions, President
OL,14,FVolodymyr Zelensky, who was not at the
OL,15,Ftalks, said they had proved
OL,16,F"constructive and quite substantive".
OL,18,FSpeaking from Paris, US Secretary of
OL,19,FState Marco Rubio also said the meeting
OL,20,Fhad been "very productive".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
