OL,3,APolice officer dies and another injured
OL,4,Aafter backpack explosion in northern
OL,5,ASpain
OL,6,
OL,7,FA police officer has died and another
OL,8,Fhas been injured in the northern
OL,9,FSpanish city of Oviedo after an
OL,10,Fexplosive device went off at the scene
OL,11,Fof a shooting.
OL,13,FThe blast happened when officers from
OL,14,FSpain's canine unit and explosives
OL,15,Fdisposal unit arrived and examined a
OL,16,Fsuspicious backpack following reports
OL,17,Fof a dispute between neighbours on
OL,18,FTuesday morning.
OL,20,FA woman who had been shot and the
OL,21,Finjured officer have been taken to
OL,22,Fhospital for treatment.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
